      "text": "ODT turns one work item into 7 governed stage prompts: Intake, Impact, Tech Design, Code, Unit Tests, Compliance, Verify\nOCI GenAI can generate stage prompts; fallback templates keep the workflow resilient\nReviewer edits and stage overrides can refine any stage before delegation\n\nIntegration points: ODT/FEDIT, reports/odt, local context server, target repo, OCI GenAI, and OCA Codex/Cline\n\nDecision logic: unclear input triggers prompt hardening; changed scope triggers re-analysis; OCI unavailability triggers fallback prompts\n\nAutomation boundaries: no auto-merge, no approval bypass, and no final delivery without human diff review.\n\nHuman review remains active before delegation and before final acceptance\n\n",
